OL,3,GNEWSATown's high street closed due to
OL,4,A'serious incident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's high street is closed while
OL,7,Femergency services deal with what the
OL,8,FBBC understands is a serious incident.
OL,10,FRegent Street in Kingswood, Bristol,
OL,11,Fhas been shut by Avon and Somerset
OL,12,FPolice, with the South Western
OL,13,FAmbulance Service also in attendance.
OL,15,FImages shared online show a cordon
OL,16,Foutside the Kings Chase Shopping
OL,17,FCentre.
OL,19,FIn a brief statement a spokesperson for
OL,20,Fthe police said officers are at the
OL,21,Fscene and the road is closed in both
OL,22,Fdirections.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
